{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring Diamond Painting to Life in a Relaxing Creative Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of diamond painting in a calming digital environment. Choose from a variety of beautiful artworks in different sizes, and fill them with colorful dots to complete your masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools inspired by real diamond painting: slice the transparent cover layer with a knife, place dots with a peaker that can hold 1 to 10 pieces and rotate horizontally or vertically, and remove mistakes with a precision tweezer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between round or square-shaped dots and enjoy the tactile satisfaction of each placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of the craft or just looking for a relaxing way to unwind, this game captures the essence of real diamond painting in an intuitive and engaging way.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906690/c8667541f6672e0f9d9f09d5b3eb60e2125c140a.jpg"},{"name":"First extra easy canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906690/2d55410f22183a3d7224d2ee3409327d4ea56cb0.jpg"},{"name":"First easy canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906690/39351090cfad62ae41cee557e2f904bc2615efa5.jpg"},{"name":"First medium canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906690/be68cae05c30a0e5bc07d87973cb82ffe947ed60.jpg"},{"name":"First large canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906690/6ee389a4fbdfab62f858ff3c9bbdf5bac42fb762.jpg"},{"name":"First extra large canvas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3906690/dfd9f8ea4f071fd63157400cdc4466e39a33208c.jpg"},{"name":"First Steam workshop installation","path